<title>USA: N.J. Transit note deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>N.J. Transit note deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced New Jersey Transit Corp.'s $352 million grant anticipation note deal, raising yields five basis points in all but the 1999 maturity.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>NEW JERSEY TRANSIT CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $351,595,000*</p>
<p>CAPITAL GRANT ANTICIPATION NOTES</p>
<p>SERIES 1997 A</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>NO NEW ORDERS.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa(FSA 2000-2003) S&amp;P: AAA(FSA 2000-2003)  FITCH:</p>
<p>	   UNDERLYING: Aa3    UNDERLYING: A+	UNDERLYING: AA</p>
<p>DATED: 04/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/1999 UNINS     14,795M    4.625 %	  4.55</p>
<p>				   (PRICE CALL 03/01/1999  100.00)</p>
<p>09/01/2000   FSA	7,630M    4.80  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2000   FSA     76,895M    5.00  %	  4.80</p>
<p>				   (PRICE TO CALL 03/01/2000    100.00)</p>
<p>09/01/2001   FSA	5,725M    4.90  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2001   FSA     83,980M    5.25  %	  4.90</p>
<p>				   (PRICE TO CALL 03/01/2001    100.00)</p>
<p>09/01/2002   FSA	4,525M    5.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2002   FSA     89,690M    5.40  %	  5.00</p>
<p>				   (PRICE TO CALL 03/01/2002    100.00)</p>
<p>09/01/2003   FSA	6,335M    5.10  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2003   FSA     62,020M    5.50  %	  5.10</p>
<p>				   (PRICE TO CALL 03/01/2003    100.00)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: OPTIONAL REDEMPTION:</p>
<p>		   FOR EACH SERIAL MATURITY, NOTES MATURING ON</p>
<p>SUCH MATURITY DATE SHALL BE SUBJECT TO OPTIONAL REDEMPTION, IN WHOLE OR IN PART, BY ON THE IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING INTEREST PAYMENT DATE OR ANY DATE THEREAFTER, WITHOUT PREMIUM OR PENALTY AT PAR PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST, BUT ONLY FROM GRANTS RECEIVED UNDER THE FFGA.</p>
<p>     NOTES MATURING ON...	   ARE CALLABLE ON AND AFTER...</p>
<p>		   SEPTEMBER 1, 1999		MARCH 1, 1999</p>
<p>		   SEPTEMBER 1, 2000		MARCH 1, 2000</p>
<p>		   SEPTEMBER 1, 2001		MARCH 1, 2001</p>
<p>		   SEPTEMBER 1, 2002		MARCH 1, 2002</p>
<p>		   SEPTEMBER 1, 2003		MARCH 1, 2003</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 6, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
